  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Ajay Tomar\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Ajay Tomar</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Jul 30, 2026 at 11:57 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/hyderabad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyderabad</a>: Amid 49 <a href=\"/tag/covid-19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Covid-19</a> cases reported in <a href=\"/tag/andhra+pradesh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Andhra Pradesh</a>, govt hospitals in Hyderabad are seeing a rise in enquiries for RT-PCR tests, though <a href=\"/tag/telangana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Telangana</a> has reported no Covid-19 cases so far.Doctors at <a href=\"/tag/osmania+general+hospital+%28ogh%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Osmania General Hospital (OGH)</a> and <a href=\"/tag/niloufer+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Niloufer Hospital</a> said people seeking tests include travellers, those with mild respiratory symptoms, and attendants of elderly or immunocompromised patients.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>At OGH, an elderly man who reported loss of taste after travel was advised to undergo an RT-PCR test despite having no fever or other typical symptoms. Others with sore throat, cough or fever have also enquired about testing, while attendants of elderly patients have sought tests as a precaution. Niloufer Hospital has also received enquiries from pregnant women but refers them to OGH as it lacks RT-PCR facilities.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>OGH superintendent <a href=\"/tag/dr+rakesh+sahay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr Rakesh Sahay</a> said around 30 RT-PCR tests have been conducted over the past two months, with Niloufer referring a similar number of patients. “None of the samples tested positive, but whenever we have a doubt, we recommend testing,” he said, adding that testing is done only on clinical advice based on symptoms or travel history.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Area hospitals, basti dawakhanas, primary health centres, Fever Hospital and Niloufer Hospital are referring suspected cases requiring RT-PCR tests to tertiary care centres.Director of public health <a href=\"/tag/dr+ravinder+naik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr Ravinder Naik</a> said routine Covid testing is unnecessary in the absence of outbreaks or clusters. “Covid-19 is now endemic. Testing should be limited to patients with influenza-like illness, severe respiratory symptoms, or those linked to suspected clusters. Others should continue preventive measures, especially while travelling to states reporting higher case numbers,” he said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>He added that the health department is closely monitoring the situation and has found no evidence of local transmission in Telangana.The increase in enquiries comes days after the state health department issued a fresh advisory urging people to remain vigilant, maintain hand hygiene, wear masks in crowded places and healthcare settings, and for elderly people, pregnant women and those with chronic illnesses to seek medical attention early if they develop respiratory symptoms.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Ajay Tomar</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Ajay Tomar</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Jul 30, 2026 at 11:57 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Jul 30, 2026 at 11:57 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">2 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n   